# Generated artifacts
*.pdf
# ...but archived PDFs are content, not artifacts. The repo archives rather than
# deletes; without this, `git mv` into docs/archive/ reads as a plain deletion and
# the file stops travelling with the clone.
!docs/archive/*.pdf
